 o dispositivi di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8U0qS9NjJUMQ7kNvwEMg9X8&_nc_oc=Adqdc7vXo7GLjWBGdRTJdOluN74oA7MJpj_EleEXlHz5DePN0lSGjeVcFRitZuL0a3s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSya6jY76kD7zRwU2Mf-Hd7DfpXU0M_Dn2o3tyWp2jP2Q&oe=6B05C4E3"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PzrAEMboQTMQ7kNvwEcIfmX&_nc_oc=Adpwq8reLTsEYDMEFziKGG56D7nF7wL8QPL1vCCHQ7ZobMPmU1QX6X-CwIzIantrzIc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ45istzprok8Laa8NCftkPOmYFig58bJXtyKpP5XJXyg&oe=6B05B0DD"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xj7KtnlfgCoQ7kNvwFgw_lg&_nc_oc=Adr6FsU-lgns00yTordwwCd9QGJ8picT_JDzXB99ey2nrPU9xGX-y2DRCwCFaeAef20&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTP2bexZz-xgNXYE4KsmtHDjC